  "description": {
   "en": "kotome game world. As she struggles to cope with this sudden turn of events, a scream reaches her ears, signaling the arrival of yet another problem: \"Why have I become that country bumpkin!?\" There, standing before her, is Irene, the original villainess, now in the form of the player character (the protagonist)!? If Konami leaves the sharp-tongued Irene to her own devices, both of them will face ruin...! So, Konami, now in the role of the villainess, decides to guide Irene, who has taken on the protagonist's role, and aims for the game's TRUE ending! The body-swapping fantasy between an efficiency-obsessed gamer and a former villainess begins now!"
